{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31607","headline":"谪仙吟赠赵道士 · 李羣玉","name":"谪仙吟赠赵道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汗漫东游黄鹤雏，缙云仙子住清都。\n三元麟凤推高座，六甲风雷閟小壶。\n日月暗资灵寿药，山河直拟化生符。\n若爲失意居蓬岛，鳌足尘飞桑树枯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}